# Copy to functions/.env and fill in before deploying to production.
# Firebase loads functions/.env automatically for 2nd-gen functions.

# Comma-separated browser origins allowed to call the callable functions.
# No trailing slashes.
#
# LEAVE THIS UNSET FOR THE FIRST DEPLOY. The *.vercel.app origin does not exist
# until Vercel has built the project once, and a list that omits the origin you
# are actually testing from fails as an opaque browser CORS error. Unset means
# any origin is accepted (the firebase-functions default) and the functions log
# a [cors] warning at cold start, so it cannot be forgotten quietly.
#
# Fill it in and redeploy once every real origin is known:
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://bibleoguessr.com,https://www.bibleoguessr.com,https://bibleoguessr.vercel.app,http://localhost:5173
